# Empire of Gold — environment template
#
# This prototype needs NO secrets, API keys, tokens or credentials to run.
# There is no database, no backend service and no third-party API call. Copy
# this file to `.env.local` only if you want to override one of the values
# below; `npm run dev` and `npm run build` work with no .env file at all.
#
# Never commit a real `.env` / `.env.local` — both are ignored in .gitignore.

# Port the dev/production server listens on. Next.js default is 3000.
# PORT=3000

# Set by the tooling, not by hand. `next build` sets it to "production", which
# is what selects the .next-prod build directory in next.config.ts.
# NODE_ENV=development
